# Papa’s All-In-One — Privacy Policy

**Last Updated: September 14, 2026**

Papa’s All-In-One (“the Bot”) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be processed when you use Papa’s All-In-One on Discord.

## 1. Information We May Process

Depending on which features are enabled on a Discord server, Papa’s All-In-One may process information such as:

- Discord User IDs
- Discord Server IDs
- Discord Channel IDs
- Discord Role IDs
- Usernames and display names
- Server configuration settings
- Bot command usage
- Ticket information
- Moderation-related information
- Economy balances and related game data
- Giveaway participation
- Information required to provide specific Bot features

We only intend to process information necessary to operate and improve the Bot's features.

## 2. Discord Account Information

Papa’s All-In-One does not require users to create a separate account simply to use the Bot on Discord.

The Bot may process Discord-related identifiers and information made available through Discord's systems when necessary to provide its features.

Papa’s All-In-One does not request or collect Discord passwords.

## 3. How Information Is Used

Information may be used to:

- Provide and operate Bot features.
- Save server configurations.
- Manage tickets and support features.
- Provide moderation and logging features.
- Maintain economy and other gameplay systems.
- Manage giveaways and rewards.
- Troubleshoot errors and abuse.
- Improve the reliability and functionality of the Bot.
- Respond to support requests.

## 4. Information Sharing

We do not sell users' personal information.

Information processed by Papa’s All-In-One may be handled by services required to operate the Bot, such as Discord, Bot hosting, databases, or other technical service providers.

We do not intentionally share personal information with third parties except when reasonably necessary to operate the service, comply with legal obligations, protect the service, or respond to legitimate requests.

## 5. Data Retention

Information may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to provide the relevant Bot features.

The amount and type of information retained may depend on the features enabled by a server.

When information is no longer necessary for the operation of a feature, it may be deleted or removed according to our available systems and procedures.

## 6. Server Administrators

Server administrators control which Papa’s All-In-One features are enabled in their server.

Administrators are responsible for configuring features appropriately and should avoid using the Bot to collect unnecessary personal information from their members.

## 7. Data Deletion Requests

If you would like information associated with your Discord account or server to be reviewed or deleted, contact the Papa’s All-In-One support team.

Please provide enough information for us to identify the relevant server, account, or data.

Some information may need to be retained when required for security, legal, fraud-prevention, or operational purposes.

## 8. Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information processed by Papa’s All-In-One.

However, no online service can guarantee complete security, and we cannot guarantee that information will never be accessed, altered, or disclosed due to circumstances outside our reasonable control.
## 9. Children's Privacy

Papa’s All-In-One is intended to be used in accordance with Discord's age requirements and policies.

We do not intentionally collect personal information from children in violation of applicable laws.

## 10. Third-Party Services

Papa’s All-In-One operates through Discord and may rely on third-party services for hosting, databases, APIs, or other technical functionality.

Those services may process information according to their own privacy policies and terms.

## 11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy as Papa’s All-In-One develops or as our data practices change.

When changes are made, the “Last Updated” date will be updated.

## 12. Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how Papa’s All-In-One handles information, please contact us through the official Papa’s All-In-One support server.

